# npm cache — CLAUDE.md mandates `npm install --cache ./.npm-cache`
# because the Bash sandbox blocks writes to ~/.npm. It is a build artefact and
# must never be committed: it put 60 files and a single 41MB blob into a commit.
.npm-cache/

